WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.620
An old promise to King David: your
throne will be established forever.

2
00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:10.930
Centuries later, many Jews hoped for a
king who would drive out foreign rulers.

3
00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:15.860
But in Mark's Gospel, Jesus tells his
disciples to tell no one about him.

4
00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.680
And Paul calls Christ
crucified a stumbling block.

5
00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:24.070
So why do the Gospels show a
Messiah who suffers and hides?

6
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:27.410
In this mission, you'll meet
the many hopes of Jesus' day,

7
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.720
not just one.

8
00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:32.970
Then you'll ask who Isaiah's
Suffering Servant really is.

9
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:38.270
Your mission: find out why the Gospels
show a Messiah who suffers and hides.
